  "visualBrief": "An earth-colored entrance with a wide vehicle aperture, sloping side wings and separate pedestrian openings. Two elongated figures run across the lintel beneath a fish-shaped iron crest. Scalloped iron leaves open into the grove. The fish-shaped crest retains open jaws, a forked tail and overlapping plates. The two open iron leaves have distinct cast silhouettes and raised folds from the 2023 frontage photograph. Concealed metalworking details remain interpreted.",
